    {
      "text": "nothing hid, which shall not be manifested, Mark 4:22. he should be made manifest to Israel, John 1:31. Jesus … manifested forth his glory, John 2:11. that his deeds may be made manifest, John 3:21. works of God should be made manifest in him, John 9:3. I … will manifest myself to him, John 14:21. that which may be known of God is manifest in them, Rom. 1:19. righteousness of God without the law is manifested, Rom. 3:21. Every man’s work shall be made manifest, 1 Cor. 3:13. secrets of his heart made manifest, 1 Cor. 14:25. it is manifest that he is excepted, 1 Cor. 15:27. life also of Jesus might be made manifest in our body, 2 Cor. 4:10. made manifest unto God … manifest in your consciences, 2 Cor. 5:11. manifest by the light: for whatsoever doth make manifest, Eph. 5:13. hid … but now is made manifest to his saints, Col. 1:26. God was manifest in the flesh, 1 Tim. 3:16. good works of some are manifest beforehand, 1 Tim. 5:25. made manifest by the appearing of our Saviour, 2 Tim. 1:10. was manifest in these last times for you, 1 Pet. 1:20. life was manifested, and we have seen it, 1 Jn. 1:2. ye know that he was manifested to take away our sins, 1 Jn. 3:5. In this the children of God are manifest, 1 Jn. 3:10. In this was manifested the love of God, 1 Jn. 4:9.",
